","kind":"update","title":"V20261023 Update","summary":"Update NotesMajor Changes:Weight, Load, and March Speed Overhaul Different supplies now calculate weight individually. Horses increase the army’s carrying capacity. Army size, carried supplies, terrain, and current status all affect march speed — the more overloaded, the slower the movement. Weight and speed explanations have been added to the inventory, market, and troop tooltips.Bloodstain Effects on Units and Portraits Injuries, melee contact, and kills during combat now gradually leave blood","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:24:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033396","verified_at":"2026-10-22T16:34:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4801600-1846651706684182","game_id":"steam-4801600","kind":"update","title":"Update","summary":"Key adjustments include the following: 1. Modified grid dimensions (width and height) to ensure a more consistent visual experience for camera angles in both tactical and world-map views. 2. Introduced a non-flat design: all units now have a semi-upright, \"chess-piece-like\" visual appearance. 3. Added 12 new trade goods and implemented a feature allowing players to inquire about trade prices at taverns. 4. Added combat visual effects to 90% of all skills. 5. Significantly buffed settlement build","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T09:30:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684182","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4801600-1846018067938455","game_id":"steam-4801600","kind":"announcement","title":"Origin Cinematics, Medicine, and Other Changes","summary":"Origin Cinematics All eight origins now have a simple introductory cinematic. Each one has three parts: the origin's background, its story, and the character's entry into a world at war, with illustrations for each stage. Hold Space to skip. Here are the GIFs recorded from the game: Europe Knight — The Old Oath Endures Guild — Intrigue Beyond the Ledger Middle East Oasis Scout — Dusk on the Oasis Trail Desert Caravan — Camel Bells at the Pass North Asia Raiding Vanguard — Riders on the Wind Camp","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T13:11:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938455","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4801600-1846018067932218","game_id":"steam-4801600","kind":"announcement","title":"10.9Update","summary":"Local legends come to life in this update.The new folklore event pack brings 36 stories across East Asian, European, North Asian and Middle Eastern cultures—nine for each. Meet 23 new cultural unit types: eight East Asian, including two Taoist reinforcement types; five European; four North Asian; and six Middle Eastern, plus a summoned Soul Vessel. From restless corpses and fox spirits to draugr, nightmares and jinn, these encounters feature distinct abilities and tactical challenges. Investigat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T05:37:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067932218","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4801600-1845383656396503","game_id":"steam-4801600","kind":"announcement","title":"Battle Voices Are Here, Alongside a Unified UI Art Style","summary":"Battle Voices ImplementedWe have added 46 Chinese battle voice lines. Each attack made by a human unit has a 50% chance to trigger a randomly selected voice line.The lines cover six categories: General, Melee, Archers, Crossbowmen, Cavalry, and Bandits. Horse archers share the cavalry voice pool. Different troops now have their own battle cries, while bandits have dedicated taunts—including two lines in Cantonese.We have also matched loudness across the recordings and adjusted their balance agai","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T13:53:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396503","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4801600-1845383656395014","game_id":"steam-4801600","kind":"update","title":"Yuanrong UI Update","summary":"SettlementsFormationsCharacter progressionInventoryMilitary encyclopediaCampaign objectives","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T01:21:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656395014","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4801600-1844751498229437","game_id":"steam-4801600","kind":"update","title":"September 27 Update","summary":"New ContentAdded 16 special quests, with more event chains and choices along the way.Added a building encyclopedia covering all four cultures. Browse upgrade paths, effects, garrisons and construction requirements.Added a settlement information panel showing local conditions, completed buildings and their levels when you enter a settlement.Pacing and BalanceReduced Health and Organization recovery rates. Troops now need more time to recover after battle instead of returning to full strength almo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-27T15:34:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498229437","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4801600-1844751498224493","game_id":"steam-4801600","kind":"update","title":"September 25 Update: Quest Events, Travel Events, and Mercenary Contracts","summary":"Event Choices and Skill ChecksWhile traveling or completing quests, you may now encounter events with several ways to respond. Some options require an attribute check, and certain checks can be handled by a capable companion. The chance of success is shown beside the option.New Quest Event BranchesFive existing quest types now include event branches:Letter Delivery: You may be intercepted by people demanding the letter. You can hand it over, invent a cover story, or fight. If negotiations fail, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T13:08:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498224493","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4801600-1844751498219780","game_id":"steam-4801600","kind":"update","title":"Update Notes: Troop Progression, Bandit Camps, and Combat Fixes","summary":"Troop Progression & EquipmentAdded the ability to spend Doctrine Points to grant experience to your troops.Added equipment notifications when your inventory contains an item suitable for a character’s empty equipment slot.Adjusted troop progression, significantly reducing the experience required to upgrade to the highest troop tier.Increased the prices of upgrade materials.Added an upkeep cost preview to the troop upgrade interface.World Map & CampsAdded visible camps to the four areas with conc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T23:01:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498219780","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4801600-1844115010504333","game_id":"steam-4801600","kind":"announcement","title":"Roadmap Announcement | Upcoming Content","summary":"Demo PhaseTarget Date: October 31, 2026The Demo phase will focus on strengthening the core gameplay loop. Planned additions include:More Quest Types We will add more standard quests and mechanics-driven quests to give players more meaningful choices and activities across the world.Events and Skill Check System We plan to introduce an event system inspired by Crusader Kings. Event outcomes will be influenced by the player’s attributes, abilities, and other relevant values, with probability-based ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T14:13:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010504333","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4801600-1844115010502449","game_id":"steam-4801600","kind":"update","title":"September 22 Update Notes","summary":"Settings InterfaceRedesigned the settings interface layout.Moved language selection to a separate menu.Separated UI scale and FPS options.Added improved Esc support for closing menus and pop-ups.New installations now start in English by default.4K ResolutionFixed UI drifting issues at 4K resolution.Other ImprovementsImproved windowed-mode resolution handling.Improved UI scaling on high-resolution displays.Adjusted bandit and beast progression curves for smoother world progression.Improved menu c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T20:18:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010502449","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4801600-1844115010499847","game_id":"steam-4801600","kind":"update","title":"September 21 Update: Quest, Combat & Save Stability Fixes","summary":"Quests & World Map • Adjusted event battles for Defend the Village, Escort the Caravan, and Escort Supplies: keep the event “Engage” and no longer generate additional enemy armies on the world map. • Fixed the Escort Supplies event incorrectly linking to patrols of other nations. • Fixed an issue where multiple armies sharing the same settlement’s supply would exceed the actual stock when calculating reinforcement budget, causing abnormal reinforcements or interruption of world time progression.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T21:18:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010499847","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4801600-1844115010498209","game_id":"steam-4801600","kind":"update","title":"Yuanrong — September 20 Major Update","summary":"Yuanrong Update: Battle Doctrines, Equipment, and Performance ImprovementsThis update introduces two new systems for army progression: battle doctrines and equipment.1. New ContentBattle Doctrines: Develop Your Army’s Fighting StyleInfantry, Ranged, or Cavalry—choose a direction that suits your armyThe doctrine tree offers three main directions—Infantry, Ranged, and Cavalry—with 84 nodes and 18 specialization paths. Choose your path based on your army composition and preferred tactics.The full d","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T01:45:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010498209","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4801600-1841579228669352","game_id"